# Cassandra CQL: Apache Cassandra documentation: The Cassandra Query Language (CQL 3); requirements/languages/cassandra.md
name     cassandra cassandra-cql
keyword  SELECT FROM WHERE AND INSERT INTO VALUES UPDATE DELETE CREATE DROP ALTER TABLE KEYSPACE
keyword  INDEX TYPE PRIMARY KEY WITH IF NOT EXISTS USING TTL ORDER BY LIMIT ALLOW FILTERING
keyword  BATCH BEGIN APPLY USE GRANT REVOKE CLUSTERING REPLICATION IN
type     ascii bigint blob boolean counter date decimal double float inet int smallint text time
type     timestamp timeuuid tinyint varchar varint list set map frozen tuple
builtin  true false null now uuid toTimestamp
fold-case
line-comment   -- //
block-comment  /* */
string   ' '  : doubled
string   $$ $$  : multiline
string   " "  : name
operators  =<>+-*/;,.(){}[]?:
calls
